OBSERVE p21-before reserveUnspent total=104000 dust=undefined/undefined
PASS p21-red-total-counts-dust the base counts every positive note (104000) and reports no residue — the total every host holds the quote to
PASS p21-d5-gate-clears-for-a-receipted-dust-stray a refunded 4,000-zat stray (paid from other notes) never keeps the return waiting — the dust note is residue, not debt
OBSERVE p21-before seeded batch 1 47bcd15f5de5c688… change 30000 + dust note 4000
OBSERVE p21-before settle exit=0
  | {"auction_id":"ba24d4e31bd28ec15e7a139863820ed5d8ed59b9540cb870c8ac7c6a11171426","settled":5}
  | ERROR signer alice could not list derivable rows: ERROR sign derivable refused: public check failed: ERROR accounting-strays refused: a reserve-return row or receipt without the published reserve_return accounting
  | ERROR signer bob could not list derivable rows: ERROR sign derivable refused: public check failed: ERROR accounting-strays refused: a reserve-return row or receipt without the published reserve_return accounting
  | ERROR signer carol could not list derivable rows: ERROR sign derivable refused: public check failed: ERROR accounting-strays refused: a reserve-return row or receipt without the published reserve_return accounting
  | ERROR settle refused: no signer host could list its derivable rows
  | ERROR reserve-return pass exited 1; the reserve stays in the vault until the next benzo settle
PASS p21-red-parks-forever run 1 parks the return with the typed reason (exit 0, no receipt, no accounting) — the dust note walls the scanned-total comparison
PASS p21-red-reason-is-the-total-mismatch the typed reason names the true wall: the tool's quote spends 30000 zats of the scanned unspent total 34000 (it rides on the published exception row)
PASS p21-red-every-rerun every re-run dies harder (exit 1): the base publishes the bare reserve-return exception row, which its own verify refuses ("a reserve-return row or receipt without the published reserve_return accounting"), so no host can answer the public check ever again — the wall no honest re-run can pass
RESULT PASS
